},{"name":"barred","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A fact that "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"retires","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" this row once learned. This is the lie"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the actor stops telling."}]}]},{"name":"taught","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A fact the player learns by hearing this answer."}]}]},{"name":"condition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A live condition on the world, checked when the player asks."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use this where "},{"code":"knowing:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"unless:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" don’t fit — those are for what the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player has worked out, this is for what is currently true."}]}]},{"name":"again","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What the actor says when this is raised a second time,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overriding the table’s own "},{"code":"again:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Conversation\/topics(of:for:fallback:again:_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" for the rules."}]}]},{"name":"id","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A stable key for the heard set. Give one to a row whose keywords or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gates you expect to edit after release, to a row on an actor who shares"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a display name with another, or to two rows that should retire"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"together. Also the only way to name a row for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Conversation\/hasHeard(_:from:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"name":"line","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What the actor says. Ends the turn."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The topic row."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Matching is by keyword rather than by whole phrase: a keyword matches when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every word in it appears somewhere in what the player typed. So"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"topic(\"murder\", \"body\")"},{"type":"text","text":" answers "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ask butler about the murder"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"… about that dreadful murder"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"… about the body"},{"type":"text","text":" alike, while"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"topic(\"murder weapon\")"},{"type":"text","text":" needs both words present."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/topic(_:only:knowing:unless:learning:when:again:id:reply:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A topic the actor answers with one line."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Topic rows","generated":true,"anchor":"Topic-rows","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/topic(_:only:knowing:unless:learning:when:again:id:perform:)","doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/TopicEntry","doc:\/\